#claude
# Everything under .claude/ is local EXCEPT skills/, which are project
# assets: tests/test_audit_docs_match_cli.py asserts the existence AND
# content of .claude/skills/audit-live/SKILL.md. Ignoring the whole tree
# made those four tests unpassable on a fresh clone and in CI, while
# presenting as a missing file rather than as a packaging mistake.
# `.claude/*` (not `.claude/`) is required: git will not descend into an
# excluded DIRECTORY, so a negation inside one can never re-include it.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

